  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and the foot of the required normal is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Hence, the equation of the required normal is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>125</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>135</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
